{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>את</b> — Rabbi Moses said: עד מאוד clinging to Your statutes, like ולא פחדו מאותם. And Balaam's son said: כי עד מאד like לעד. And in my opinion: I shall keep Your statutes and You — do not forsake me עד מאד. And the meaning: forsaking such that I cannot keep them."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 119, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:40:12.033685450Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}